description: Use gstack for AI-assisted engineering in this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Use gstack for substantial work in this repository. Install/update Cursor skills from a gstack checkout with `./setup --host cursor`.

Preferred routing:
- feature: office-hours when needed -> plan-ceo-review -> plan-eng-review -> review -> qa
- design: plan-design-review -> design-shotgun/design-html when useful -> design-review
- bug: investigate before fixing
- security-sensitive changes: cso
- performance-sensitive changes: benchmark

Read `README.md` before changing build, dependencies, runtime, auth, bindings, D1/Drizzle or deploy. Preserve the repository lifecycle. Never work directly on `main`. Do not automate land-and-deploy; merge/deploy requires human approval.
